How it was made
- The story ideas, characters, structure, choices and edits are the author's.
- The story text was drafted with AI help (Claude, by Anthropic) from the
  author's direction, then chosen and edited by the author.
- The illustrations were generated with AI (ChatGPT) from prompts and
  direction written by the author, then chosen and arranged by the author.
  Images made only by an AI tool may not be protected by copyright in some
  countries.

